                                                "sense_id": "4e9d2283-31ce-3bd3-8f8c-de55777045fd",
                                                "text": "Gott strafe the roll-call, hurrah for the 'Mikes,' / Hurrah for the rebel boys that organised the strikes, / For everywhere the roll was called their names they didn't know."
